      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. can u expand on that? specifically, how can i frame the idea that the current way things are—like meritocracy and private property rights—is actually just a way to keep the racial wealth gap alive? i want to make sure i'm not just saying it's \"unfair,\" but that it's fundamentally broken and doesn't work.",
